/**
\struct ImGUIWrapper::IEditorTool
\ingroup editor
\brief Base class of editor tools. Override `Draw_Internal()`; optionally override `OnOpenStateChanged(bool)`. `bOpen` says whether the tool is drawn.

Declared at \src{include/Editor/ImGuiWrapper/EditorTool.hpp,10,23}. Open tools with CoreEditor::Open().

\genexopen{modules/EditorTools.cpp,Tool}
\snippet modules/EditorTools.cpp tool
\endex
*/

